<title>USA: Sled Dogs signs European distributor.</title>
<headline>Sled Dogs signs European distributor.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sled Dogs Co, maker of snow skates and related accessories, said Thursday it contracted Schicke Vertriebs GmbH to market, sell and distribute its products in Germany, Australia, Switzerland, Belgium, Luxembourg and the Netherlands.</p>
<p>The agreement calls for product orders each year for the next three years.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
